# Originals: the big photos, the logo artwork, the Graphik family. Roughly 85MB,
# none of which belongs on the live site — the build turns them into the small
# files in assets/. Kept on Shawn's Desktop only.
#
# Sources live in source/ and generated files in assets/, deliberately never in
# the same folder: when the logo originals sat beside the generated ones, nine
# of them got committed and shipped to the live site by accident.
/source/
